            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erstelle die <code>result</code>-Variable und speichere den Rückgabewert der Funktion darin.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"signUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status = user + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Signed up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = signUp(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Desmond&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"110\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>const</code>, gefolgt von <code>result</code> und schließlich <code>\"Desmond\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erstelle die Konstante <code>result</code> und speichere den Rückgabewert, wenn <code>signUp</code> <code>\"Desmond\"</code> erhält.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"signUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status = user + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Signed up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = signUp(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Desmond&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>const</code>, gefolgt von <code>result</code>, <code>signUp</code> und schließlich <code>\"Desmond\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
